&lt;div class=&quot;col-sm-9 col-12 content&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;col-sm-9 col-12 content&quot;&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/hwHBs9V_a4I?si=p-tFLv6DVVsnjCKv&quot; width=&quot;301&quot; height=&quot;169&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/DxDjFTeyYaU&quot; width=&quot;301&quot; height=&quot;169&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a web frontend engineer to join PayPay. You will be building features that change how people in Japan use and manage their finances and business. As a fast-paced company leading the payments industry, we need our engineers to be versatile and enthusiastic to take on new challenges in order to stay at the forefront.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Product Managers, Designers and various tech teams to implement features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the team by sharing knowledge, participating in code reviews, and providing feedback to uphold and ensure best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Triage, debug, and resolve product issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Tech Stack&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;｜TypeScript, JavaScript, HTML/CSS&lt;br&gt;｜Vue.js, React, NestJS, Express.js, single-spa&lt;br&gt;｜Docker, Kubernetes, ArgoCD, AWS, GH Actions, Terraform, Gatling&lt;br&gt;｜GitHub, npm/yarn, Jenkins, Webpack, Jest, i18n, Storybook&lt;br&gt;｜Sentry, Kibana, Google Analytics, Firebase, NewRelic&lt;br&gt;｜Figma, PlantUML, draw.io&lt;br&gt;｜Slack, Zoom, Confluence, Jira&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 5 years of industry experience developing secure web frontend applications in JavaScript and/or other transpile-to-JavaScript languages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 1 year of industry experience with VueJS (preferred), or React.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Software engineering best practices and computer science knowledge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business level of English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Additional Qualifications&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with frontend performance monitoring and optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with iOS or Android development, either with the native toolkits or with a framework such as React Native.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with designing server side RESTful APIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with web hosting infrastructure such as CDNs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;PayPay 5 senses&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Please refer &lt;a href=&quot;https://speakerdeck.com/paypaycorporation/e1f1b5f41d8b3b6f7982ed4ca7619d58&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;PayPay 5 senses &lt;/a&gt;to learn what we value at work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
